Z||000008||MikeSchaefer||08-11-2001||10:15 PM||||Thanks for coming guys, it was a lot of fun.  If anyone has digital pictures, I would love to see them, I'll be scanning mine and <BR>putting them on a website.  I had a lot of help with this show and can't thank those people involved enough for all of their help.  I think next year we're going to make it a charity food-drive and have a fund collecting  cook out type thing going.  I have a while to think about that though.<BR>Thanks again,<BR>Michael Schaefer <A HREF="http://surf.to/fiero" TARGET=_blank>http://surf.to/fiero</A> ||||reg||1
